  m_text: "<size=14><color=#2f2b2b>  10-100 Purple carriages with 25-2500 coins and
    chance to win Grand Jackpot at the end\n  10-100 Red carriages with 15-2000 coins
    and chance to win Major Jackpot at the end\n  10-100 Blue carriages with 10-1000
    coins and chance to win Minor Jackpot at the end\n  10-100 Green carriages with
    5-100 coins and chance to win Mini Jackpot at the end\n  <b>Depending on Cash/Colored
    Train Symbols on reels, Colored Train Features and Sum of Cash Symbols</b>\n 
    3-10 Golden carriages <b>with sum of previous Train Features and Cash Symbols
    as a carriage value</b>\n  8-15 Platinum carriages <b>with sum of previous Train
    Features and Cash Symbols as a carriage value</b></color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
